WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.035
Today your child reads sentences, and then a story.

2
00:00:03.485 --> 00:00:05.101
These are today's two pages.

3
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:13.452
Two small words on the page cannot be sounded out neatly. Do not ask your child to sound them out. Just tell them what each one says.

4
00:00:13.902 --> 00:00:18.336
Show your child that a sentence starts with a big letter and ends with a period.

5
00:00:18.786 --> 00:00:22.578
They read each sentence out loud. Then they read it again, smoothly.

6
00:00:23.028 --> 00:00:25.911
The second time is where it starts to sound like talking.

7
00:00:26.361 --> 00:00:30.363
Then turn to the story. Every word in it is a word they have practiced.

8
00:00:30.813 --> 00:00:34.713
Let them read it to you. Then let them read it to someone else in the family.
